{"availability":"available","full":"dguywhoknows/nl-to-sql","name":"nl-to-sql","description":"Ask questions about data in plain English. A real SQLite engine runs in your browser while AI writes, repairs and explains the SQL.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-07T03:34:49Z","updated":"2026-10-17T04:48:39Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/nl-to-sql/","topics":["github-pages","javascript","llm","sql","sqlite","wasm"],"demo":"https://dguywhoknows.github.io/nl-to-sql/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T04:02:34.683Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T04:02:34.683Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T04:02:34.683Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:18.564Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:47:33.716Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-20T04:02:34.683Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Ask questions about data in plain English. A real SQLite engine runs in your browser while AI writes, repairs and explains the SQL.","SQL Copilot loads SQLite (compiled to WebAssembly) into the page, seeds a realistic e-commerce database (customers, products, orders, line items, with seasonality and refunds), and lets you query it in English. The AI sees the live schema plus sample rows, writes a query, and if SQLite rejects it, gets the exact error back and repairs the query automatically. You can also import your own CSV files."],"features":["Real SQLite via sql.js/WebAssembly, with no server","Seeded, reproducible sample DB with 1,500 orders across 2 years","English → SQL with schema-aware prompting and an automatic error-repair loop (up to 3 tries)","Guardrail that refuses to run non-read-only AI queries","Auto chart: line chart for time series, grouped bars for categories"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dguywhoknows/nl-to-sql/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5f8057e6c4cd8907a8aeb34eb993